Copyright 2026 Kaki contributors.

Kaki is an independent Python implementation inspired by Pico Harness
(https://gitee.com/htxoffical/pico-harness, reference revision
d6c7a648fd7ee63e472c0d438f1c8299d9b8f871), licensed under Apache-2.0.

The context selection, tool-call closure, Curator planning and emergency
shrinking mechanisms were reimplemented with reference to Pico's architecture.
Kaki's Textual UI, SQLite execution journal, Responses adapter and independent
shadow-Git implementation are maintained in this repository.

The full Apache License 2.0 is included in LICENSE. Third-party packages retain
their respective licenses and are pinned in uv.lock.
